The templates take each language's kind names from its own grammar and its
layout from its own serializer: CSS Syntax Module Level 3 and CSSOM (W3C),
RFC 8259 and ECMA-262 (JSON), Prisma's datamodel grammar and formatter
(prisma-engines), and TypeScript's parser and printer (typescript-go). Module
kinds follow the Next.js file conventions. No code from those projects is
included.
